    20                              <1> ; Flash signature revisions:
    21                              <1> ; XUB212	Added a proper ROMVARS flag for MODULE_MFM_COMPATIBILITY (FLG_ROMVARS_MODULE_MFM_COMPATIBILITY).
    22                              <1> ;			Added 5 new color themes.
    23                              <1> ; XUB211	Added device type DEVICE_8BIT_JUKO_D16X
    24                              <1> ; XUB210	Moved pColorTheme so it's not copied when loading old settings from EEPROM.
    25                              <1> ;			Added wRamVars to allow use of UMBs for storing variables in Full operating mode.
    26                              <1> ;			Increased the length of szTitle and decreased the length of szVersion for USE_PS2
    27                              <1> ; XUB209	Shortened the BIOS version string (ROMVARS.szVersion) and WORD aligned the IDEVARS structures
    28                              <1> ; XUB208	Added option to skip slave drive detection
    29                              <1> ; XTIDE207	Added device type DEVICE_8BIT_XTIDE_REV2_OLIVETTI
    30                              <1> ; XTIDE206	Added support for Color Themes
    31                              <1> ; XTIDE205	Added DEVICE_8BIT_XTCF_PIO16_WITH_BIU_OFFLOAD after other XT-CF
    32                              <1> ;			PIO modes (prevents empty indexes in PIO jump tables)
    33                              <1> ;
    34                              <1> 
